spinney.modelTable.markdownDescription:
Extra models for the dropdown, as structured data. Edit it in [settings.json](command:workbench.action.openSettingsJson?%7B%22revealSetting%22%3A%7B%22key%22%3A%22spinney.modelTable%22%2C%22edit%22%3Atrue%7D%7D) — or from the chat's **Models** panel, which shows one column per field:

```json
"spinney.modelTable": {
  "some-model": { "vision": false, "max_tokens": 1048576 }
}
```

An entry for `deepseek-flash` overrides the built-in model; any other id is added to the dropdown. A field you leave out keeps the built-in value (non-vision, 1048576 tokens). Entries that cannot be parsed are ignored and listed in the **Spinney** output channel.
